<title>MALTA: Bomb hoax delays Air Malta flight to London.</title>
<headline>Bomb hoax delays Air Malta flight to London.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Air Malta flight to London was delayed by two hours on Friday when an anonymous caller phoned Malta airport to claim there was a bomb on board.</p>
<p>An Air Malta spokesman said soldiers established it was a hoax.</p>
</text>
